	<section id="faq"
		class="tw-flex tw-w-full tw-flex-col tw-place-content-center tw-place-items-center tw-gap-[10%] tw-p-[5%] tw-px-[10%]">
		<h3 class="tw-text-4xl tw-font-medium tw-text-gray-300 max-md:tw-text-2xl">Frequently Asked Questions
		</h3>
		<div class="tw-mt-5 tw-flex tw-min-h-[300px] tw-w-full tw-max-w-[850px] tw-flex-col tw-gap-4">
			<div
				class="faq tw-w-full tw-rounded-md tw-border-[1px] tw-border-solid tw-border-[#1F2123] tw-bg-[#080808]">
				<div
					class="faq-accordion tw-flex tw-w-full tw-select-none tw-text-xl max-md:tw-text-lg">
					<span>Can ChemQC handle specialized polymer tests like MFI, OIT, and Yield
						Stress?</span>
					<i class="bi bi-plus tw-ml-auto tw-font-semibold"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="content">Yes, ChemQC provides complete flexibility to define any polymer
					test your laboratory requires. The system features an intuitive test builder
					that allows your administrators to easily configure MFI (Melt Flow Index), OIT
					(Oxidative Induction Time), Yield Stress, and any other specialized tests
					exactly according to your laboratory's protocols and specifications. This
					ensures the system adapts perfectly to your unique testing requirements rather
					than forcing you into predefined templates.
				</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="faq tw-w-full tw-rounded-md tw-border-[1px] tw-border-solid tw-border-[#1F2123] tw-bg-[#080808]">
				<div
					class="faq-accordion tw-flex tw-w-full tw-select-none tw-text-xl max-md:tw-text-lg">
					<span>How difficult is it to install and run ChemQC?</span>
					<i class="bi bi-plus tw-ml-auto tw-font-semibold"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="content"> ChemQC is designed for easy deployment and can run efficiently on
					standard computer systems without demanding high specifications. The application
					uses SQLite for database management, eliminating the need for dedicated servers
					or complex network infrastructure. It's lightweight, resource-efficient, and
					ready to use right out of the box.</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="faq tw-w-full tw-rounded-md tw-border-[1px] tw-border-solid tw-border-[#1F2123] tw-bg-[#080808]">
				<div
					class="faq-accordion tw-flex tw-w-full tw-select-none tw-text-xl max-md:tw-text-lg">
					<span>What tests and standards does ChemQC support?</span>
					<i class="bi bi-plus tw-ml-auto tw-font-semibold"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="content">ChemQC gives administrators full flexibility to define any test
					method or standard your laboratory requires. You can create and customize
					testing protocols for various standards including ISO, ASTM, and other
					international or internal specifications. The system adapts to your laboratory's
					specific testing needs rather than limiting you to predefined options.</div>
			</div>

			<div
				class="faq tw-w-full tw-rounded-md tw-border-[1px] tw-border-solid tw-border-[#1F2123] tw-bg-[#080808]">
				<div
					class="faq-accordion tw-flex tw-w-full tw-select-none tw-text-xl max-md:tw-text-lg">
					<span> Can ChemQC be adapted to the specific workflow of our plant?</span>
					<i class="bi bi-plus tw-ml-auto tw-font-semibold"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="content"> Yes, our development team can quickly create a customized model
					that maps precisely to your plant's unique workflow. We'll design a system that
					monitors and manages your entire process chain—from raw material intake through
					production and testing, all the way to final product delivery to your customers.
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="tw-mt-20 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-place-items-center tw-gap-4">
			<div class="tw-text-3xl max-md:tw-text-2xl">
				Still have questions?
			</div>
			<a href="mailto:Slotfi909@gmail.com?subject=Question About ChemQC"
				class="btn !tw-rounded-full !tw-border-[1px] !tw-border-solid !tw-border-gray-300 !tw-bg-transparent tw-transition-colors tw-duration-[0.3s]">
				Contact
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>



	<footer id="about"
		class="tw-mt-auto tw-flex tw-w-full tw-place-content-around tw-gap-3 tw-p-[5%] tw-px-[10%] tw-text-white max-md:tw-flex-col">
		<div class="tw-flex tw-h-full tw-w-[250px] tw-flex-col tw-place-items-center tw-gap-6 max-md:tw-w-full">
			<img src="./assets/logo/logo.png" alt="logo" srcset="" class="tw-max-w-[120px]" />
			<div>
				Isfahan University of Technology,
				<br />
				Isfahan,
