			<h2 class="tw-text-3xl max-md:tw-text-xl">About ChemQC</h2>
			<div class="tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-gap-3 max-md:tw-text-sm">
				<p class="tw-text-gray-300 tw-text-sm tw-leading-relaxed">
					Enterprise laboratory data management solution designed for manufacturing
					excellence and operational precision.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>



	</footer>
</Layout>
